  "description": "In Choi Hee-ji's life, Yeon Woo-hak was just a friend. That's how it was until her male friend unexpectedly started sending her unsolicited photos of himself.    \n\n\"Oh, you've come back alive, I see?\"    \n\n\"How much is it?\"     \n\nSomehow, Yeon Woo-hak is exposing his penis in front of me. And somehow, why am I staring at it so alluringly?    \n\n\"For now, it's free.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/market_price), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/lainey_132)",
